    "body": "Hehe. I got confused by this too in the past... You are looking at the 2.0 spec. There is this nifty little sentence in the Abstract: \"This document should be read as an extension to the WebGL 1.0 specification. It will only describe the differences from 1.0.\"\r\nThe events are in the 1.0 spec.\r\nFWIW: We've been landing WebGL conformance tests related to OffscreenCanvas, but the spec change has yet to land.",
