    "body": "I see, so the event names are `webglcontextlost` and `webglcontextrestored`. We should mention them explicitly (using `<code data-x=\"\">` I suppose) and include a `<ref spec=WEBGL>` at the end of the paragraph after the dot. Does that make sense @GloverDonovan?",
